#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:34
msgid "Introduction to Xorg ATI Driver"
msgstr "Introdução ao Controlador <quote>ATI</quote> do <quote>Xorg</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:37
msgid ""
"The <application>Xorg ATI Driver</application> package contains the X.Org "
"Video Driver for ATI Radeon video cards including all chipsets ranging from "
"R100 to the \"Volcanic Islands\" chipsets."
msgstr ""
"O pacote &quot;<application>Controlador ATI do Xorg</application>&quot; "
"contém o Controlador de Vídeo &quot;X.Org&quot; para placas de vídeo "
"&quot;ATI Radeon&quot;, incluindo todos os &quot;chipsets&quot;, desde "
"&quot;R100&quot; até os &quot;chipsets&quot; &quot;Volcanic Islands&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:46
msgid ""
"For Direct Rendering to work with newer Radeon Cards (R300 and later "
"chipsets), you need to enable the r300, r600 and radeonsi Gallium drivers at"
" <xref linkend=\"mesa\"/> build time. Also, some cards require Firmware to "
"be available when the kernel driver is loaded.  In that case, if you have "
"not followed the instructions in the Firmware for Video Cards part of <xref "
"linkend=\"postlfs-firmware\"/> which provided that firmware in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/lib/firmware</filename> for a modular build, firmware "
"can be obtained from <ulink url=\"&sources-anduin-http;/linux-firmware/\"/> "
"- see <xref linkend=\"xorg-ati-firmware-kernel\"/> below for additional "
"firmware."
msgstr ""
"Para Renderização Direta funcionar com placas &quot;Radeon&quot; mais "
"recentes (&quot;chipsets&quot; &quot;R300&quot; e posteriores), você precisa"
" habilitar os controladores &quot;Gallium&quot; &quot;r300&quot;, "
"&quot;r600&quot; e &quot;radeonsi&quot; em tempo da construção do <xref "
"linkend=\"mesa\"/>. Além disso, algumas placas exigem que o "
"&quot;Firmware&quot; esteja disponível quando o controlador do núcleo for "
"carregado. Nesse caso, se você não tiver seguido as instruções na parte "
"&quot;Firmware&quot; para Placas de Vídeo de <xref linkend=\"postlfs-"
"firmware\"/> que forneceu esse &quot;firmware&quot; em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/lib/firmware</filename> para uma construção modular, "
"[então] o &quot;firmware&quot; pode ser obtido a partir de <ulink "
"url=\"&sources-anduin-http;/linux-firmware/\"/> - veja-se <xref "
"linkend=\"xorg-ati-firmware-kernel\"/> abaixo para &quot;firmware&quot; "
"adicional."

