msgstr "Observações de Usuário(a): <ulink url=\"&blfs-wiki;/xorg-ati-driver\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:127
msgid "Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:130
msgid ""
"Enable the following options in the kernel configuration and recompile the "
"kernel if necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Habilite as seguintes opções na configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo,"
" se necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:134
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<literal>Device Drivers  ---&gt;\n"
"  Graphics support ---&gt;\n"
"   &lt;*&gt; Direct Rendering Manager (XFree86 ... support) ---&gt; [CONFIG_DRM]\n"
"   &lt;*&gt; ATI Radeon                                          [CONFIG_DRM_RADEON]</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>Device Drivers  ---&gt;\n"
"  Graphics support ---&gt;\n"
"   &lt;*&gt; Direct Rendering Manager (XFree86 ... support) ---&gt; [CONFIG_DRM]\n"
"   &lt;*&gt; ATI Radeon                                           [CONFIG_DRM_RADEON]</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:145
msgid "Kernel Configuration for additional firmware"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo para <quote>firmware</quote> adicional"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:148
msgid ""
"If you need to add firmware, install the file(s) and then point to them in "
"the kernel configuration and recompile the kernel if necessary. To find out "
"which firmware you need, consult the <ulink url=\"&radeon-marketing-"
"names;\"> Decoder ring for engineering vs marketing names</ulink>. Download "
"any firmware for your card which is named like: "
"<filename><replaceable>&lt;ENGINEERING_NAME&gt;</replaceable>_rlc.bin</filename>,"
" etc. Note that for R600 and R700 family, generic "
"<filename>R600_rlc.bin</filename> and <filename>R700_rlc.bin</filename> are "
"necessary in addition to the model specific firmware, while for later "
"generations you need the <filename>BTC_rlc.bin</filename> in addition to the"
" model specific firmware.  Below is an example for a Radeon HD6470 which is "
"a \"Northern Islands\" GPU, plus an RTL network chip that also requests "
"extra firmware:"
msgstr ""
"Se você precisar adicionar &quot;firmware&quot;, [então] instale o(s) "
"arquivo(s) e então aponte para ele(s) na configuração do núcleo e recompile "
"o núcleo se necessário. Para descobrir qual &quot;firmware&quot; você "
"precisa, consulte o <ulink url=\"&radeon-marketing-names;\">Anel "
"decodificador para nomes de engenharia versus nomes de mercadologia</ulink>."
" Baixe algum &quot;firmware&quot; para a tua placa que seja nomeada como: "
"<filename><replaceable>&lt;NOME_ENGENHARIA&gt;</replaceable>_rlc.bin</filename>,"
" etc. Observe que para a família &quot;R600&quot; e &quot;R700&quot;, "
"&quot;<filename>R600_rlc.bin</filename>&quot; e "
"&quot;<filename>R700_rlc.bin</filename>&quot; genéricos são necessários além"
" do &quot;firmware&quot; específico do modelo, enquanto para gerações "
"posteriores você precisa do &quot;<filename>BTC_rlc.bin</filename>&quot; "
"além do &quot;firmware&quot; específico do modelo. Abaixo está um exemplo de"
" uma &quot;Radeon HD6470&quot; que é uma &quot;GPU&quot; &quot;Northern "
"Islands&quot;, além de um &quot;chip&quot; de rede de intercomunicação "
"&quot;RTL&quot; que também solicita &quot;firmware&quot; extra:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:163
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<literal>CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE=\"radeon/BTC_rlc.bin radeon/CAICOS_mc.bin radeon/CAICOS_me.bin\n"
"radeon/CAICOS_pfp.bin radeon/CAICOS_smc.bin rtl_nic/rtl8168e-3.fw\"\n"
"CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE_DIR=\"/lib/firmware\"</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE=\"radeon/BTC_rlc.bin radeon/CAICOS_mc.bin radeon/CAICOS_me.bin\n"
"radeon/CAICOS_pfp.bin radeon/CAICOS_smc.bin rtl_nic/rtl8168e-3.fw\"\n"
"CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE_DIR=\"/lib/firmware\"</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:169
msgid ""
"CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE should all be on one line.  It is shown above as two "
"lines for presentation only."
msgstr ""
"&quot;CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE&quot; deveriam estar todos em uma linha. Eles "
"estão mostrados acima como duas linhas somente para apresentação."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:176
msgid ""
"You can check <command>dmesg</command> output after boot to see which "
"firmware is missing."
msgstr ""
"Você pode verificar a saída gerada do &quot;<command>dmesg</command>&quot; "
"depois da inicialização para ver qual &quot;firmware&quot; está ausente."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:182
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you change CONFIG_DRM_RADEON to '=m' in your .config the "
"firmware can be loaded automatically from /lib/firmware/radeon when it "
"installs the module. This offers a tiny space saving, but also means that "
"the screen will be blank for a longer time before the framebuffer appears. "
"Distros take this approach because it is not practical to specify every "
"possible firmware and the kernel would be excessively big."
msgstr ""
"Alternativamente, se você mudar &quot;CONFIG_DRM_RADEON&quot; para "
"&quot;=m&quot; em teu &quot;.config&quot;, [então] o &quot;firmware&quot; "
"poderá ser carregado automaticamente a partir de "
"&quot;/lib/firmware/radeon&quot; quando instalar o módulo. Isso oferece uma "
"pequena economia de espaço, mas também significa que a tela ficará em branco"
" por mais tempo antes que o &quot;framebuffer&quot; apareça. As "
"distribuições adotam essa abordagem porque não é prático especificar todos "
"os &quot;firmwares&quot; possíveis e o núcleo seria excessivamente grande."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:191
msgid "xorg-ati-firmware"
msgstr "xorg-ati-firmware"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:196
msgid "Installation of Xorg ATI Driver"
msgstr "Instalação do Controlador <quote>ATI</quote> do <quote>Xorg</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:211
msgid ""
"First, apply a patch including fixes for known performance regressions and "
"future problems with Xorg-Server."
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, aplique um remendo incluindo correções para regressões de "
"desempenho conhecidas e problemas futuros com o &quot;Xorg-Server&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:215
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../xf86-video-ati-&xorg-ati-driver-"
"version;-upstream_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../xf86-video-ati-&xorg-ati-driver-"
"version;-upstream_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:218
msgid ""
"Install <application>Xorg ATI Driver</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Controlador &quot;ATI&quot; do "
"&quot;Xorg&quot;</application>&quot; executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:222
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:226
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:230
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-ati.xml:233
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

